# ESP32-S3 with octal PSRAM (S3R8, S3R16V) and wired Ethernet (a W5500 over SPI): Waveshare
# ESP32-S3-ETH. For wired S3 boards: a Wi-Fi-only S3 board runs esp32s3-octal, and a wired
# S3 with the Wi-Fi backup (net.c: Wi-Fi only while the cable is out) stays here.
#
# esp32s3-octal, plus speed bought with internal RAM. A Wi-Fi S3 can't spare that RAM (the
# XIAO ESP32S3 Sense on Wi-Fi bottoms out at 28.6 KB of internal RAM free on esp32s3-octal),
# so these options are an image of their own. Measured on the Waveshare ESP32-S3-ETH, a
# 3,000 qps flood, share answered:
#   esp32s3-octal (the lean W5500 driver)                    30.5%
#   + the 32 KB instruction cache                            64%,   heap free 75 KB
#   + the SPI master and lwIP's packet path in IRAM          78.6%, heap free 62 KB, p50 30 ms
# (both measured with lwIP core locking and the Ethernet input under its lock as well; the
# options without those are not measured).
#
# The same chip, PSRAM and flash layout as esp32s3-octal: a node moves between the two over
# the air (firmware/CMakeLists.txt, sibling images).
CONFIG_IDF_TARGET="esp32s3"
CONFIG_ESP_DEFAULT_CPU_FREQ_MHZ_240=y
CONFIG_SPIRAM=y
CONFIG_SPIRAM_MODE_OCT=y
CONFIG_SPIRAM_SPEED_80M=y
CONFIG_SPIRAM_IGNORE_NOTFOUND=y
# The instruction cache at 32 KB, not 16: the other 16 KB come out of internal SRAM.
CONFIG_ESP32S3_INSTRUCTION_CACHE_32KB=y
# The SPI master's transfer path (every W5500 frame) and lwIP's packet path run from IRAM,
# not from flash through the cache.
CONFIG_SPI_MASTER_IN_IRAM=y
CONFIG_LWIP_IRAM_OPTIMIZATION=y
# PSRAM first, internal RAM only if that fails, for two allocators (IDF 5.5): the Wi-Fi
# driver's heap (esp_adapter.c wifi_malloc/calloc/realloc), only while the backup runs; and
# all of lwIP's heap (lwipopts.h mem_clib_malloc; MEM_LIBC_MALLOC and MEMP_MEM_MALLOC route
# pbufs, PCBs and netbufs through it), always, on Ethernet too: outgoing packets and the
# pbuf headers around received frames (the W5500 driver's frame buffers are unchanged).
# With SPIRAM_IGNORE_NOTFOUND set, the Kconfig defaults that follow this option (more Wi-Fi
# RX buffers, static TX buffers, TCP out-of-order limit) stay as on esp32s3-octal.
# wifi_up() logs the internal RAM free before and after Wi-Fi starts.
CONFIG_SPIRAM_TRY_ALLOCATE_WIFI_LWIP=y
